    "answer": {
      "short": "$16a^4-32a^3b+24a^2b^2-8ab^3+b^4$",
      "worked": "Replace $b$ by $-b$. The terms with odd powers of $b$ change sign.\n$$\\begin{align*}(2a-b)^4&=16a^4+32a^3(-b)+24a^2(-b)^2+8a(-b)^3+(-b)^4\\\\(2a-b)^4&=16a^4-32a^3b+24a^2b^2-8ab^3+b^4\\end{align*}$$",
